## Framework 2: Terratest (Go) Integration Tests

Use only when real cloud resources are needed to validate behavior.

### Constraints
- Always `defer terraform.Destroy(t, opts)` before `InitAndApply`
- Use `t.Parallel()` unless tests share resources
- Never hardcode credentials — use `os.Getenv` or dedicated `.tfvars` file (git-ignored)
- Tag all test resources with `managed_by = "terratest"`

### Test Template

```go
package test

import (
    "testing"

    "github.com/gruntwork-io/terratest/modules/terraform"
    "github.com/stretchr/testify/assert"
)

func Test{{MODULE_PASCAL_CASE}}(t *testing.T) {
    t.Parallel()

    opts := &terraform.Options{
        TerraformDir: "../../",
        Vars: map[string]interface{}{
            {{TERRATEST_STANDARD_VARS}}
        },
    }

    defer terraform.Destroy(t, opts)
    terraform.InitAndApply(t, opts)

    resourceName := terraform.Output(t, opts, "name")
    assert.NotEmpty(t, resourceName)
}
```

### File Layout
`tests/integration/{module}_test.go`

